<title>USA: Triple P CEO, President Yazdi to resign.</title>
<headline>Triple P CEO, President Yazdi to resign.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch software company Triple P N.V. said Monday that Fezi Khaleghi Yazdi would be resigning his position as chief executive and president effective September 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that there will be a transition of Yazdi's responsibilities to Jan Willem Baud, the chief operating officer.</p>
<p>However, a company spokesman said that Baud had not yet officially been named Yazdi's successor.</p>
</text>
